<section class="source-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="marketplace-principle-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>PRINCIPE CENTRAL</p>
      <h2 id="marketplace-principle-heading">MARKETPLACE IS NOT A STORE. IT IS A WEATHER SYSTEM.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li>
        <h3>THE SHITHAWK</h3>
        <p>A local acquisition hazard disguised as a deal. Not necessarily bad, but always carrying hidden costs: space, time, gas, cables, repair work, emotional energy, or a new project branch.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>CONTAINMENT INFRASTRUCTURE</h3>
        <p>Any purchase that reduces chaos instead of multiplying it: standardized cans, shelves, label makers, drawer units, inventory sheets, bags, desiccant, QR labels, and field logs.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>THE TEST</h3>
        <p>Will this impose order, or merely hold disorder?</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="evidence-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="marketplace-taxonomy-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>TAXONOMY</p>
      <h2 id="marketplace-taxonomy-heading">THE COMMON LOCAL HAZARDS.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="progression-list">
      <li class="active">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Storage</h3>
        <p>Bins, trunks, cabinets, shelves, ammo cans, filing drawers. Approved only when they impose order.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Tool</h3>
        <p>Promises future usefulness. Buy only if it solves an active bottleneck.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Electronics</h3>
        <p>Usually missing a cable, screw, adapter, driver disc, or one truth. "Works, just haven't tested it" is a warning label.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Artifact</h3>
        <p>Beautiful, useless, magnetic. FI may acquire artifacts, but only intentionally.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Free Item</h3>
        <p>Price: zero. Cost: time, gas, awkward pickup, and a new pile. Free is not free unless it enters the system immediately.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>06</span>
        <h3>Car Portal</h3>
        <p>Do not engage casually. Daylight, sober adult, mechanic mindset, and defined exit strategy required.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>07</span>
        <h3>Side Quest</h3>
        <p>Begins with "that would be easy to fix." No side quests during containment operations.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

