<section class="evidence-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="inspection-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>INSPECTION</p>
      <h2 id="inspection-heading">VERIFY CONTAINMENT-GRADE BEFORE ACQUISITION.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li>
        <h3>CHECK</h3>
        <p>Lids latch cleanly / seals serviceable / no major interior rust / no oil, chemical, or mildew smell / no sharp damaged seams / consistent size and stackability / seller honors bulk rate.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>BRING</h3>
        <p>Gloves / flashlight / cash / towel or blanket for transport / one sample small-part bag if desired.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>NUMBER</h3>
        <p>If acquired, assign FI-CAN-001 through FI-CAN-050. Reserve FI-CAN-000 // QUARANTINE for unidentified objects awaiting classification.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>PROHIBIT</h3>
        <p>No unlabeled cans. No permanent "misc."</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

